    <comment>WinBoat is an Electron app which allows you to run Windows apps on Linux using a containerized approach. Windows runs as a VM inside a Docker/Podman container, they communicate with it using the WinBoat Guest Server to retrieve data they need from Windows. For compositing applications as native OS-level windows, they use FreeRDP together with Windows's RemoteApp protocol.</comment>
